{"4189580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultra Mega Dungeon 64", "steam_appid": 4189580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/42df9da6b2c48abbfa144f4db66e6d66.avif?t=1781905706\" width=256 height=256 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top down ARPG / Roguelike heavily inspired by the Nintendo 64 era of graphics. Take charge against waves of monsters to reach the boss. Can you survive all 10 waves with careful specs into your Strength, Dexterity, Intelligence, (and lucky loot drops) or be forced to try, try, and try again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/f14e9bfd1e22461ccd40fbacaec6ffd7.poster.avif?t=1781905706\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/f14e9bfd1e22461ccd40fbacaec6ffd7.webm?t=1781905706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETA FEATURES (Available Now):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded progression systems</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are now automatically earned and applied by using each weapon type - a more <i>natural</i> progression</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More bosses and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online 4 player Co-Op support!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/7d54a2ff1fa07e65010de96436d85b24.avif?t=1781905706\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/891fec679316e2f726def4fcb3469d35.poster.avif?t=1781905706\" width=196 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/891fec679316e2f726def4fcb3469d35.webm?t=1781905706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/891fec679316e2f726def4fcb3469d35.mp4?t=1781905706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/42df9da6b2c48abbfa144f4db66e6d66.avif?t=1781905706\" width=256 height=256 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top down ARPG / Roguelike heavily inspired by the Nintendo 64 era of graphics. Take charge against waves of monsters to reach the boss. Can you survive all 10 waves with careful specs into your Strength, Dexterity, Intelligence, (and lucky loot drops) or be forced to try, try, and try again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189580/extras/f14e9bfd1e22461ccd40fbacaec6ffd7.poster.avif?t=1781905706\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared